#: includes/class-privacy.php:160
msgid "3. Data and data subjects. People who send prayer requests (name, contact, phone and the text of the request, which may include data about health and religious beliefs, special categories of data); the people prayed for (name, relationship and the circumstances told); the members of the group (name, how they are called, phone, birthday, date of death and notes); the people invited to lead the group (name and email)."
